{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44782","headline":"归山作 · 护国","name":"归山作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"諠静各有路，偶随心所安。\n纵然在朝市，终不忘林峦。\n四皓将拂衣，二疏能挂冠。\n窓前隐逸传，每日三时看。\n靳尚那可论，屈原亦可叹。\n至今黄泉下，名及青云端。\n松牖见初月，花间礼古坛。\n何处论心怀，世上空漫漫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"护国","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}